WEBVTT

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.740
Shining bright!

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.710
Smile Precure!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.340
I'm late! I'm late!

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.760
I'm Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.390
I'm a picture-book-loving eighth grader.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:36.420
It's my first day at my new school, but now I'm late and in real trouble.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.070
But the weather today is great,

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.400
and I'm feeling good!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.870
Maybe something ultra happy is going to happen!

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.310
Rounding a bend on the way to school,

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.240
I sense a wonderful encounter coming!

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:52.550
What was I thinking?

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:54.670
As if things would be like a picture book!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.050
<i>Kuru~</i>

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:58.280
What was that?

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:00.490
Where—?

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.220
<i>Kuru~</i>

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.140
A bird?

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.300
A crow?

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.470
A book?

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:14.870
Wait! It's coming this way!

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:40.430
<i>Kuru?</i>

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:43.000
How cute!

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.730
Are you a dog? A cat? A raccoon dog?

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:46.980
What's your name?

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.820
My name is Candy, <i>kuru~</i>

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:55.040
I'm a fairy from the land of picture books: Märchenland, <i>kuru~</i>

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.880
The land of picture books? A fairy?

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:01.650
A wonderful encounter for picture-book-loving me!

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:04.250
A fairy at that! A <i>fairy!</i>

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:04.720
I can't stay here!

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.990
Wait, it <i>talked!</i>

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.570
Hey, will you be my fri—

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:09.220
Huh?

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:11.040
Candy?

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:14.190
Oh, I was dreaming!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.790
What's this?

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.540
I wasn't dreaming!

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:25.970
School!

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:28.070
What could this mean?

00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:30.730
I get the feeling that something…

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.670
…incredibly happy is going to happen!

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.580
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.430
Smile Precure!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.310
Let's go!

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:40.860
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.000
All together!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.610
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:45.810
Jump to tomorrow!

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:48.480
Smile Precure!

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:53.320
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:58.740
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:03.960
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:09.880
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.830
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:14.800
So bright!

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:20.010
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:26.430
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.940
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:28.110
Let's go!

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:30.820
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:33.740
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:38.550
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.120
Girls! Let's go!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.790
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.910
Everybody!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.580
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:46.120
Fly to the future!

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.630
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.800
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.090
Smile Precure!

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:09.270
So, now I'll introduce the new transfer student.

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:12.880
Okay, Hoshizora-san, introduce yourself.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.110
Yes!

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.360
What? Why am I so nervous?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.410
It's alright. I practiced for this.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.300
But I'm too nervous!

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.330
You can do it!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.310
But I can't!

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:30.760
But I've got to do it! I've got to do it!

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.060
We're waiting!

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:35.600
Huh?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.150
Introduce yourself!

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.240
O-Okay!

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.360
Err, I'm Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:46.580
Um… I… err… anyway, I'm p-pleased to meet you!

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.260
Is that it?

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.020
No! Where's the punchline?

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.990
Alright! I'll do the introduction for you!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:57.360
Hmm, let's see.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.730
You look like a real airhead, but deep down you're really focused.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:05.300
And you've got a little brother who loves looking at the stars.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.270
His name is… let's see…

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:08.630
Hoshizora Mitarô!

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:08.630
TL: Also means, "Let's look at the stars!"

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:12.710
Yeah! They liked it! They liked it!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:13.810
Okay, next up—

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.140
Akane!

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.690
This isn't helping Hoshizora-san, is it?

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.320
That's right!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.780
Besides, introductions are something you should do for yourself.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:23.990
Okay, okay!

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:27.020
I'll take this opportunity to introduce you to these two.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.330
Over there is Midorikawa Nao.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:33.310
She's good at sports, but she's soft-hearted and has a real sense of duty.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.060
She's kind of like a gangster girl, don't you think?

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.040
G-Gangster?

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.730
G-Gangster?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:42.010
That young lady there is Aoki Reika.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.470
She's class rep and vice president of the student council.

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:47.640
She's a top student and all the boys
think she's a real hottie, too!

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:48.740
Hottie?

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.550
And I'm Hino Akane!

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:55.930
I moved from Osaka last year, so I know exactly what's it's like to be new student.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.080
Okay, that's enough.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.020
Thanks, Hino-san.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.680
Now, back to your seat.

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:04.060
That's all folks!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.160
Thank you! Thank you! Merci beaucoup!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.630
Don't worry about it!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:14.330
Akane-chan was just fooling around to help loosen you up a bit.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.900
That girl's Kise Yayoi!

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:17.970
She's a total crybaby.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.810
If you tease her even a little bit, she bursts into tears!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.280
D-Don't say things like that to her!

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.170
I've only cried…

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.750
…three times, you know!

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.050
Thanks, everyone!

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:38.420
I'm not nervous any more, thanks to your help.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.240
I'll start again. I'm Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:45.360
I love picture books. Ever since I was little, I've always read them a lot.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:50.040
I think it's wonderful how stories in picture books always have a happy ending,

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:53.030
so I look for that kind of happiness in every day.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.110
What do you mean?

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:59.380
As in, what does happiness mean to you?

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:02.630
Err, it's hard to explain in words…

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:05.770
…but if everyone around here had a kind of twinkle…

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.720
…and were really excited…

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:11.360
…um… anyway, it's an
“Everybody's ultra happy!” kind of thing.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:14.690
I'm not sure I totally get it.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.900
But, I think we kind of do.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.770
So, on that note,

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:20.500
I'm pleased to meet you!

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.810
Now, then, Hoshizora-san will sit…

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:30.900
Me! Me!

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.010
There's a free desk behind me!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.460
You're right.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:36.460
Hoshizora-san will sit over there.

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:37.470
Okay!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.150
Pleased to meet you, Hino-san.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.220
Same! Pleased to meet you!

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:45.790
Alright, time to start homeroom.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:49.050
I was so nervous! I'm glad I managed to introduce myself.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.130
I have to find the Precure, quickly, <i>kuru~</i>

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.360
Candy?!

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:57.770
It's Candy! Look!

00:07:58.810 --> 00:07:59.740
Huh?

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.510
There's nobody there!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.210
Hoshizora-san?

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:05.080
I-I'm sorry…

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:09.720
The due date is nearly here, so you'd better make your decision soon.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.960
Going home already? How about I show you around the school?

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:17.860
Thanks!

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.660
But you must have club activities. I'll be okay by myself!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.080
Okay, well, see you tomorrow!

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.060
Yeah, goodbye!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.490
Bye bye!

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.570
Candy wasn't just a dream!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.390
She couldn't be somewhere here at school, could she?

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:36.070
Alright! Time to explore the school!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.550
What a big music room!

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:47.750
Here's a science lab.

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.720
Is this the library?

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:55.200
A library without any people is kind of mysterious!

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.650
What?

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.150
What could this light be?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.540
It's from inside the bookshelf.

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:16.050
Huh?

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.630
Again?

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.460
Alright!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.330
What? What? What is this?!

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:41.360
What? The books are glowing!

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:52.450
Precure! Where are you?

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.770
A wolf has showed up, <i>kuru~</i>

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:09.850
Happy!

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.720
Candy!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.810
That hurts!

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.600
Amazing!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.070
Where am I?

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:45.060
How pretty!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.040
Is this…?

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.510
I knew it!

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:53.650
All the walls are lined with books! Fantastic!

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:54.640
Huh?

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:57.890
These are just like the book from before.

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:03.740
It's glowing again!

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.170
<i>Kuru!</i>

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:09.660
<i>Kuru!</i>

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:10.860
Candy?!

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.170
Where are the Precure, <i>kuru?</i>

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:17.040
Wh-What's going on? Candy's on the other side!

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:19.440
I can't s— Wh-What's going on?

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:22.040
I can't see Candy!

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.010
Geez!

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:28.170
Again?

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.550
Where am I?

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.880
The bookshop at the shopping center?

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.770
Wh-What's going on?

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:43.810
Candy! This way!

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:46.750
Candy!

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.540
Found you!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.270
A wolf! A wolf!

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.060
<i>Kuru!</i>

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.280
Candy!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.940
Wait a minute!

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.710
<i>Kuru!</i> A wolf has come from the sky!

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:05.010
There's no way th—

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.090
There really <i>is</i> something there!

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:12.060
I'll get started with this town.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:14.090
The world,

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:15.890
and the worst possible ending.

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:18.400
Be stained with a Bad End!

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:21.530
I'll blot out the pages where your future will be written!

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.660
What?

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:30.050
Wolfrun is trying to give the world a Bad End, <i>kuru!</i>

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:31.340
“Bad End”?

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.050
That means a terrible future!

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:34.860
“A terrible future”?

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.620
What's going on?

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:40.820
It's over!

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.790
It's hopeless even trying.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:46.270
Oh, no, <i>kuru!</i> Bad Energy is coming out of everybody!

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:47.660
“Bad Energy”?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.940
The Bad Energy from these humans

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:54.840
is bringing back our Pierrot-sama,

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:57.370
the Emperor of Evil!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.540
Stop it, <i>kuru!</i>

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:05.680
W-W-Wait! Candy!

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.620
So you've come to this world, too?

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.580
Don't give the world a Bad End, <i>kuru!</i>

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.920
What's that? What are you talking about?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.220
The future will lead to nothing but a Bad End.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:21.130
Whatever you try to do is hopeless.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.690
You're wrong, <i>kuru!</i>

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.480
It won't be hopeless at all, <i>kuru!</i>

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:29.500
I'm sure people can be happy if they try, <i>kuru!</i>

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:32.670
Whatever you reckon.

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.820
<i>Ku, kuru~</i>

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:39.610
It's just as Candy says!

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:42.850
My self-introduction didn't go well.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.340
But I didn't give up and kept trying.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.190
My classmates helped me and things worked out in the end.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:50.270
Doing your best, to the very end, no matter what.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:52.680
If you do that, then one day

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.560
you can definitely be happy!

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.060
What are you on about?

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.290
Stop blathering and hand her over!

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.430
I'll eat her up!

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:01.260
<i>Kuru~</i>

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.300
<i>Kuru?</i>

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.200
I've decided.

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:09.180
Aren't you scared of me?

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:10.920
Of course I'm scared!

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:13.150
Then what are you sticking up for her for?

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.640
I don't know.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:18.350
But if someone is going to pick on this little creature,

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.720
I'll try to protect her, no matter who it is!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:22.820
<i>Kuru~</i>

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.070
Aren't you the cocky one?

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:27.670
In that case, I'll eat you first!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.260
Run away, <i>kuru!</i>

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.230
You think you can?

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.330
Leave me and save yourself!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.470
I can't do that!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.510
But I'm scared!

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:37.570
Keep on running. I'll chase you.

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:40.240
At this rate, you'll get eaten, too!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.760
But I made my decision! I'll do everything I can!

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:45.440
I think what you said was right, you know!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.110
<i>Kuru~</i>

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.920
Whatever you do will only come to nothing!

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:51.880
<i>Kuru!</i>

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:57.390
Now, give up and hand her over!

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.220
I'm not giving up!

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:03.360
When I've decided to do whatever I can, I'll see it through to the end!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.600
Little brat!{TL: I've got an8 here for now, but there must be a better solution.}

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:07.480
That's what… That's what…

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.930
I reckon that for you two little pals

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:09.900
it's time for beddy byes!{TL: sic. This is essentially as he says it.}

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:12.500
…being happy is to me!

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.380
What's that?

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:23.420
What's this?

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.380
Could <i>you</i> be…?

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:28.990
What's this?

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.630
A Smile Pact, <i>kuru!</i>{TL: パクト is a Japanese word for a comPACT, portable makeup case. I can't find the word "pact" on English makeup sites, but I can't find an equivalent English word, either.}

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:31.580
Huh?

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:34.740
You're one of the legendary warriors: a Precure, <i>kuru!</i>

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:35.660
What's that?

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:38.710
Put the Smile Pact together with a Cure Décor

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:41.730
and cry “Precure Smile Charge!”

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:45.040
I don't really understand…

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.340
…but I'll give it a shot!

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.310
Ready?

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.620
Precure Smile Charge!

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:55.670
Go!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.430
Go! Go!

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.540
Let's go happy!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.540
The light of the future,

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.960
shining bright!

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.110
Cure Happy!

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:34.720
I've found a Precure, <i>kuru!</i>

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.690
What's this?

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:46.750
It's… It's so cute!

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:49.370
What's up with her?

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:54.240
Calm down! Now you're a legendary warrior: a Precure!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.420
A legendary warrior? A Precure?

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.000
That's right, <i>kuru!</i>

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.650
When you say “warrior”, you don't mean…?

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:03.150
You'll fight the wolf, <i>kuru!</i>

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.620
No way! No way! I'm scared!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.340
But you're a Precure!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:10.560
But what's a Precure?!

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.060
A legendary warrior, <i>kuru.</i>

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:13.350
Whatever. What do I care?

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:13.360
What's that?

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:15.590
I'll make you regret your cockiness!

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:15.590
<i>Like I said…</i>

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:18.840
That's right! If he's a wolf…

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:20.010
Where are you going, <i>kuru?!</i>

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.700
Never mind! Never mind!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:22.870
What?

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:27.380
In the story of the three little pigs, the wolf couldn't blow down the house of bricks!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.700
A happy end!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.340
I see, <i>kuru!</i>

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:37.450
You fools! I can do <i>this!</i>

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:41.150
Come out, Akanbe!

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:44.000
Wh-What?

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:44.820
Run away, <i>kuru!</i>

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.260
Akanbe!

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:51.630
A brick monster!

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:53.700
That's called an Akanbe.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:59.670
It's a monster born through Pierrot-sama's power, when Cure Décor power is converted to a Bad End.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:01.240
Cure Décor!

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.120
What's he saying?

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.360
Go forth, Akanbe!

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.350
Akanbe!

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:09.580
I'm scared!

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:11.970
What?

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.200
What's going on?

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.930
Amazing, Happy, <i>kuru!</i>

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.580
What's going on?

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:25.000
Akanbe!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.740
Wait a— How do we get down from here?

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:29.600
The Akanbe's coming, <i>kuru!</i>

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.640
Akanbe!

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.770
Get away from me!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.100
Wha—?

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.500
What was that super power I just used?

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:46.310
Precures are warriors who defend the world, <i>kuru!</i>

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.810
Oh, I get it now!

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.490
So, I'm a TV super hero, right?

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.890
That's not it, <i>kuru!</i>

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:55.320
Leave it to me! I'll give this a shot!

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:56.720
So, what's next?

00:18:59.010 --> 00:18:59.950
I'm scared!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.800
Don't run! Fight, <i>kuru!</i>

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:03.930
What's up with her?

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:04.870
Akanbe!

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:08.330
It's after us!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.360
Use the Happy Shower to cleanse the Akanbe, <i>kuru!</i>

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:12.210
What's that?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.550
It's your Precure healing power!

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:15.690
That's cool!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.950
Got it! I'll try it!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:19.320
Get ready for this!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.350
What is it <i>this</i> time?

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:24.220
Happy! Happy!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.300
Happy Shower!

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.400
Wait, what happened?

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:39.340
Happy Shower!

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.340
What's that?

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.040
Akanbe!

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.120
Nothing happened, did it?

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.810
You didn't have enough spirit, <i>kuru!</i>

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:48.890
No way! I was totally fired up for it!

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.980
So now I'm totally embarrassed!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:55.690
Akan<i>be! —be! —be!</i>

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:57.160
Akanbe!

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:59.430
This is no good, Happy.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.970
If I keep running away, so will the happiness.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:04.870
Besides there's no way on earth

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.760
I'm letting that bad wolf beat me!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.000
The Smile Pact, <i>kuru!</i>

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:12.370
Put your spirit into the Smile Pact, <i>kuru!</i>

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:14.340
Got it!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.010
<i>Spirit!</i>

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.680
It's sucking up power!

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.800
What <i>is</i> this? It's drawing out power?

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.150
Don't stop! Keep putting power into it!

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.120
Time to call your bluff!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.120
Akanbe!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.460
Akanbe!

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:35.030
<i>Spirit!</i>

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.460
Now, <i>kuru!</i>

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:41.960
Precure!

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:45.430
Happy…

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.140
…Shower!

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.750
Akanbe!

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.300
What the…?

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:09.200
I'm totally worn out!

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:13.570
The Happy Shower uses a lot of power, <i>kuru!</i>

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:15.230
You could have told me!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.310
I was so scared!

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:22.170
What's this?

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.610
A Cure Décor, <i>kuru!</i>

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:24.720
A what?

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:27.110
Wait, what about that wolf?

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:30.700
Precure!

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:41.570
Thank goodness!

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:44.210
The people of the town are smiling again!

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:47.160
By the way, you've got a lot of explaining to do.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:50.390
I want to you to be a Precure and collect Cure Décors,

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:53.710
and then I want you to save my world!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.690
I don't understand one bit.

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.180
But this sounds interesting!

00:21:58.180 --> 00:21:59.690
You mean it, <i>kuru?</i>

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:00.650
Yeah!

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:02.670
<i>Kuru~</i>

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:04.670
What does it mean?

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.520
It could be that something incredibly happy

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:09.870
really is going to happen!

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:46.590
Candy, this Precure thing is awesome!

00:23:46.590 --> 00:23:48.380
There are five Precure all together!

00:23:48.380 --> 00:23:49.350
That many?

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:50.980
Good morning, Hoshizora-san!

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:51.960
Oh, Hino-san!

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:52.950
Want to be a Precure?

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.410
Huh? What's that all about?

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:56.650
Miyuki, Precure are supposed to be secret, <i>kuru!</i>

00:23:56.650 --> 00:23:58.950
Whoa! The sheep plushie talked!

00:23:58.950 --> 00:23:59.820
I'm no sheep!

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:01.160
I'm a fairy, <i>kuru!</i>

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:03.290
Smile Precure!

00:24:06.430 --> 00:24:08.970
Find your ultra happy smile!
